  "description": "Dappier documentation: Ask AI 2.0 for publishers, Brand Agents for advertisers, and real-time data APIs and MCP servers for developers and AI agents.",
  "contextual": {
    "options": [
      "copy",
      "view",
      "chatgpt",
      "claude",
      "mcp",
      "cursor",
      "vscode"
    ],
    "display": "header"
  },
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "Dappier has three product areas. Publishers: Ask AI 2.0 (an AI agent trained on the publisher's own content, deployed as a hosted AI Mode page or an embed), the AI Recommendations API, and analytics APIs. Advertisers: Brand Agents (a conversational AI ad format), AI Brand Builder (creates a Brand Agent from a prompt), the Sales Agent MCP at https://sales-agent.dappier.com/mcp, and the Brand Agents Analytics API. Developers and AI agents: the Real Time Search API, marketplace data models, the Dappier MCP server, Python and Go SDKs, and framework integrations.",
      "Start at /introduction for a map of every product. A full index of pages is at /llms.txt, and any page is available as Markdown by adding .md to its URL."
    ]
  }
